    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"choosing\" to give things weight feels like such a heavy, exhausting chore. if the end result is always just going back to zero, why do we have to put in all this effort to pretend it matters? it just feels like we're being forced to play a game that was rigged from the start.",
